{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t東華三院黃大仙醫院一間護養病房，再多4名男病人帶有耳念珠菌，現正接受隔離治療，情況穩定。<br/>\n<br/>\n院方表示，4名病人年齡介乎44歲至72歲，無出現感染病徵。防方繼續對病人的緊密接觸者展開追蹤篩查，已將有關個案呈報醫院管理局總辦事處及衞生署衞生防護中心作出跟進。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.451453+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:11:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:50.481419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.724742+00:00","content_hash":"c997c7ddd4617f0c3b68a441fcab5030606d10d0c5156b00f99a461dc1b5f794","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}